Third-party material
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Base MCP plugin catalogue
  lib/security/src/baseMcpPluginCatalogue.generated.ts is generated by
  scripts/refreshBaseMcpPluginCatalogue.mts from the plugin specifications
  Base publishes at https://github.com/base/skills. Only the declarative
  frontmatter of those specs is reproduced — plugin id, title, summary,
  version, chains, tags, risk, auth, shell requirement and the plugin's own
  `requires.allowlist`. Refer to that repository for its licence terms.

Protocol addresses and ABI fragments
  Router, factory, pool and token addresses for Aerodrome, Balancer, Hydrex,
  Uniswap, Moonwell, Morpho, OpenSea and o1.exchange are public on-chain
  facts, pinned here so that no deployment can substitute one silently.

Token marks
  artifacts/interface/public/marks/eth.svg is the ETH diamond from
  ethereum.org's brand assets (https://ethereum.org/en/assets/), unchanged.
  The stock icons Still's Get money shows are the ones Coinbase publishes for
  its tokenized stocks in its Tokenized Stocks API; Miorail serves them from
  its own origin and they are not part of this repository.

IP geolocation by DB-IP
  Still's region check (artifacts/api-server/lib/stillRegion.ts) places a
  connection in a country with DB-IP's "IP to Country Lite" database,
  https://db-ip.com, licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
  International License. The server downloads it each month; it is not part
  of this repository.

WalletConnect
  The web app bundles the WalletConnect SDK (@walletconnect/*), used under
  the WalletConnect Community License Agreement; its text ships with each of
  those packages as LICENSE.md.
