Morpho Blue arithmetic
  lib/rwa-issuer/src/morphoBorrowMath.ts and morphoRepayMath.ts restate the
  arithmetic of Morpho Blue (https://github.com/morpho-org/morpho-blue) in
  TypeScript, with its rounding: Morpho.sol is licensed GPL-2.0-or-later and
  its libraries MIT.
